  "type": "transform_in_place",
  "src": "8-connected grey regions in an orange field, classified by their 4-connected lobe structure",
  "transform": "recolor to teal each grey region whose 4-connected lobes form a non-branching diagonal-corner chain or whose single lobe is a square diagonal staircase; preserve all other pixels"
}
</annotation>
